Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.59,0:23:25.39,Ending-English-L0,,0,0,0,,Алыстағы естеліктер
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.59,0:23:25.39,Ending-Kanji-L0,,0,0,0,,Алыс жадта
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.59,0:23:25.39,Ending-Romaji-L1,,0,0,0,,Tooi kioku no naka
